        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Exploring Student Experiences in Virtual Learning Environments: A Qualitative Study</title>\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']] } };\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --paper:#fbffdc;\n    --mint:#b4f0ca;\n    --teal:#168d78;\n    --blue:#397dcc;\n    --black:#080808;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--black)}\n  body{\n    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    min-width:1100px;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:100%;\n    padding:6.2vw 5.3vw 4vw;\n  }\n  h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\n  .subtitle{\n    color:var(--blue);\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:clamp(24px,3.05vw,58px);\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin:0 auto 2.1vw;\n    line-height:1.05;\n  }\n  .title{\n    color:var(--teal);\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:clamp(70px,8.35vw,160px);\n    line-height:.92;\n    font-weight:900;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:2.5vw;\n  }\n  .rule{\n    height:11px;\n    background:var(--teal);\n    width:100%;\n  }\n  .authors{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:clamp(22px,2.55vw,49px);\n    margin:3.2vw 0 3.2vw;\n  }\n  .top-grid{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1.65fr 1fr;\n    column-gap:4.1vw;\n    align-items:stretch;\n    min-height:560px;\n  }\n  .section{\n    padding-top:1.2vw;\n  }\n  .section h2,.discussion h2,.conclusion h2,.references h2,.results h2{\n    color:var(--teal);\n    font-family:Impact, Haettenschweiler, \"Arial Narrow Bold\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight:400;\n    letter-spacing:-.02em;\n    font-size:clamp(29px,3.25vw,62px);\n    line-height:.95;\n    margin-bottom:1.45vw;\n  }\n  .section p{\n    font-size:clamp(17px,1.45vw,28px);\n    line-height:1.36;\n  }\n  .method{\n    border-left:10px solid var(--teal);\n    padding-left:3.7vw;\n  }\n  .intro{\n    padding-right:1vw;\n  }\n  .illustration{\n    min-height:650px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .illustration-art{\n    width:90%;\n    height:520px;\n    border:7px solid #22957d;\n    border-radius:48% 48% 45% 45%;\n    position:relative;\n    opacity:.95;\n  }\n  .illustration-art:before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:18%;\n    right:18%;\n    top:20%;\n    bottom:13%;\n    border:6px solid #22957d;\n    border-radius:50%;\n  }\n  .illustration-art:after{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:50%;\n    top:7%;\n    bottom:7%;\n    width:5px;\n    background:#22957d;\n    box-shadow:-110px 250px 0 -2px #22957d,110px 250px 0 -2px #22957d;\n  }\n  .globe-line{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:4%;\n    right:4%;\n    top:50%;\n    height:5px;\n    background:#22957d;\n  }\n  .icon{\n    position:absolute;\n    color:#22957d;\n    font-size:70px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .icon.play{left:-12%;top:14%}\n  .icon.mail{left:42%;top:-17%}\n  .icon.photo{right:-10%;top:6%}\n  .icon.music{left:-13%;bottom:4%}\n  .icon.user{right:-10%;top:45%}\n  .icon.search{right:-9%;bottom:-2%}\n  .results{\n    background:var(--mint);\n    margin:4vw -1.3vw 4vw;\n    padding:3vw 3.5vw 4.3vw;\n  }\n  .results h2{text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5vw}\n  .results-intro{\n    text-align:center;\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-size:clamp(22px,2.45vw,47px);\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin-bottom:3vw;\n  }\n  .metrics{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.1fr;\n    grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:0;\n  }\n  .metric{\n    min-height:220px;\n    padding:1.2vw 2vw;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:1.3vw;\n    border-right:10px solid var(--teal);\n  }\n  .metric:nth-child(3),.metric:nth-child(6){border-right:0}\n  .metric:nth-child(-n+3){border-bottom:10px solid var(--teal)}\n  .percent{\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-family:Impact, Haettenschweiler, \"Arial Narrow Bold\", sans-serif;\n    font-size:clamp(58px,6.6vw,125px);\n    line-height:.85;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .metric-copy{\n    font-size:clamp(17px,1.45vw,28px);\n    line-height:1.3;\n  }\n  .metric-copy strong{\n    color:var(--blue);\n    display:block;\n    font-size:clamp(18px,1.55vw,30px);\n    margin-bottom:.6vw;\n  }\n  .metric-icon{\n    color:var(--teal);\n    font-size:66px;\n    line-height:1;\n    min-width:65px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .chart{\n    display:block;\n    position:relative;\n    height:150px;\n    min-width:260px;\n  }\n  .legend{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:0;\n    top:8px;\n    font-size:18px;\n    line-height:1.8;\n  }\n  .legend span{\n    display:block;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .swatch{\n    display:inline-block;\n    width:22px;height:22px;\n    margin-right:8px;\n    vertical-align:-3px;\n    border-radius:4px;\n  }\n  .dark{background:#158b78}.mid{background:#397dcc}.light{background:#fff}\n  .donut{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:0;\n    top:4px;\n    width:190px;height:100px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .donut:before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    width:190px;height:190px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:conic-gradient(from 270deg,#158b78 0 33%,#397dcc 33% 79%,#fff 79% 100%);\n  }\n  .donut:after{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    width:92px;height:92px;\n    left:49px;top:49px;\n    background:var(--mint);\n    border-radius:50%;\n  }\n  .engage:before{\n    background:conic-gradient(from 270deg,#158b78 0 85%,#fff 85% 100%);\n  }\n  .discussion-conclusion{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:7vw;\n    padding:0 2.7vw;\n  }\n  .discussion p,.conclusion{\n    font-size:clamp(19px,1.55vw,30px);\n    line-height:1.35;\n  }\n  .conclusion{\n    border-left:10px solid var(--teal);\n    padding-left:4.3vw;\n  }\n  .conclusion h2{margin-bottom:1.5vw}\n  .conclusion strong{display:block;margin-bottom:1.2vw}\n  .conclusion ul{\n    margin:0;\n    padding-left:1.4em;\n  }\n  .references{\n    margin-top:4vw;\n    padding:0 2vw 2vw;\n  }\n  .references h2{\n    text-align:center;\n    margin-bottom:2.3vw;\n  }\n  .references .ref-rule{\n    height:10px;\n    background:var(--teal);\n    margin-bottom:2.2vw;\n  }\n  .ref-grid{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:5vw;\n    font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,27px);\n    line-height:1.38;\n  }\n  .ref-grid ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1em}\n  .ref-grid li{padding-left:.15em;margin-bottom:.35vw}\n  .ref-grid strong{font-weight:700}\n  .note{\n    margin-top:2vw;\n    font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,27px);\n  }\n  .visually-hidden{\n    position:absolute!important;\n    width:1px;height:1px;\n    padding:0;margin:-1px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    clip:rect(0,0,0,0);\n    white-space:nowrap;border:0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">Exploring Student Experiences in Virtual Learning Environments:</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">A QUALITATIVE STUDY</h1>\n    <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n    <div class=\"authors\">John H., Kylie W., Rose S.</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"top-grid\">\n    <article class=\"section intro\">\n      <h2>INTRODUCTION</h2>\n      <p>\n        The shift to virtual learning has transformed education, yet students’ lived experiences remain underexplored. This study investigates how students perceive virtual learning environments (VLEs), focusing on challenges, benefits, and overall engagement. The findings aim to inform improvements in digital education strategies.\n      </p>\n    </article>\n\n    <figure class=\"illustration placeholder\" aria-label=\"Centered illustration of virtual learning and global digital education\">\n      <figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">[Diagram: centered virtual learning illustration]</figcaption>\n      <div class=\"illustration-art\">\n        <span class=\"icon play\">▶</span>\n        <span class=\"icon mail\">✉</span>\n        <span class=\"icon photo\">▣</span>\n        <span class=\"icon music\">♪</span>\n        <span class=\"icon user\">▢</span>\n        <span class=\"icon search\">◯</span>\n        <span class=\"globe-line\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </figure>\n\n    <article class=\"section method\">\n      <h2>METHODOLOGY</h2>\n      <p>\n        This study used a qualitative phenomenological approach to examine the experiences of university students in virtual learning. Data were collected through 25 semi-structured interviews and three focus group discussions with students from diverse disciplines and academic levels. Participants were recruited via purposive sampling to ensure representation of varying levels of engagement with VLEs. Thematic analysis was conducted using NVivo software, with triangulation of interviews and focus groups to enhance validity.\n      </p>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"results\">\n    <h2>RESULTS</h2>\n    <p class=\"results-intro\">Quantitative insights were drawn from the thematic analysis to highlight key findings:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"metrics\">\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"percent\">92%</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-icon\">♟</div>\n        <p class=\"metric-copy\">of participants appreciated the flexibility of virtual learning</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"percent\">68%</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-icon\">▤</div>\n        <p class=\"metric-copy\">faced moderate to severe challenges with internet connectivity, particularly in rural areas</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"chart placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart showing challenges with internet connectivity\">\n          <figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">[Chart: challenges with internet connectivity]</figcaption>\n          <div class=\"metric-copy\"><strong>Challenges with Internet Connectivity</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <span><i class=\"swatch dark\"></i>No Issues</span>\n            <span><i class=\"swatch mid\"></i>Moderate</span>\n            <span><i class=\"swatch light\"></i>Severe</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"donut\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"percent\">76%</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-icon\">▮</div>\n        <p class=\"metric-copy\">of students felt disengaged during online classes due to limited interaction</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"percent\">85%</div>\n        <div class=\"metric-icon\">▣</div>\n        <p class=\"metric-copy\">reported increased engagement, when breakout rooms were used effectively</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"metric\">\n        <div class=\"chart placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart showing students reporting engagement improvements with breakout rooms\">\n          <figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">[Chart: students reporting engagement improvements with breakout rooms]</figcaption>\n          <div class=\"metric-copy\"><strong>Students Reporting Engagement Improvements with Breakout Rooms</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <span><i class=\"swatch dark\"></i>Engage</span>\n            <span><i class=\"swatch light\"></i>Not Engaged</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"donut engage\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"discussion-conclusion\">\n    <article class=\"discussion\">\n      <h2>DISCUSSION</h2>\n      <p>\n        The study highlights the dual-edged nature of virtual learning: while flexibility enhances accessibility, poor engagement and technical challenges hinder learning outcomes. These findings underscore the need for robust digital infrastructure, consistent use of engagement tools, and personalized support systems.\n      </p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"conclusion\">\n      <h2>CONCLUSION</h2>\n      <strong>To improve virtual learning, institutions should:</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Provide comprehensive training for students and instructors on digital tools.</li>\n        <li>Standardize engagement practices, such as interactive discussions.</li>\n        <li>Enhance technical support services and address digital equity issues.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"references\">\n    <h2>REFERENCES</h2>\n    <div class=\"ref-rule\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ref-grid\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Smith, J. A., &amp; Lee, K. H. (2021). Student engagement and motivation in virtual classrooms:</strong> A qualitative exploration. Journal of Educational Technology, 45(3), 215-229. https://doi.org/10.1234/jet.2021.0306</li>\n        <li><strong>Brown, R. T., &amp; Miller, S. P. (2020). Navigating the digital divide:</strong> Challenges and opportunities in virtual learning environments. International Journal of Distance Education, 32(2), 98-112. https://doi.org/10.5678/ijde.2020.0205</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Thompson, L. M., &amp; Garcia, M. A. (2022). Perceptions of online learning:</strong> A case study of university students during the COVID-19 pandemic. Educational Psychology Review, 35(4), 341-356. https://doi.org/10.7890/epr.2022.0402</li>\n        <p class=\"note\">[All information here is for demonstration purposes and does not reflect actual data or outcomes.]</p>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
